# Build inputs and reference material. The site loads only the derived assets in
# assets/bg, assets/chars/*.webp and assets/audio -- these are the originals that
# tools/build-assets.py reads, plus docs and prototypes. Keeping them in git but
# out of the deployment takes it from ~45MB to ~6MB.
assets/source/
assets/chars/*.gif
assets/chars/wheelie/
assets/chars/expressions/
assets/bg/gorge-src/
assets/bg/raft-src/
tools/
docs/
prototypes/
.vscode/

# Build INPUTS for the expression stills. build_stills() turns these into
# jhumru_still_body.webp plus the six face_*.webp overlays, and only those are
# fetched at runtime -- these six full characters and the zip they arrived in were
# shipping as 2.5MB of dead weight, a third of the whole bundle.
assets/chars/jhumru_expression_stills_webp*
